== r03_conversion
  san:    exit 0 run: k.l abc1 x Qbc1|baked: k.l abc1 x Qbc1|
  O3:     exit 0 run: k.l abc1 x Qbc1|baked: k.l abc1 x Qbc1|
  interp: exit 0 run: k.l abc1 x Qbc1|baked: k.l abc1 x Qbc1|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/r03_conversion.debug.san
--- run san
run: k.l abc1 x Qbc1
baked: k.l abc1 x Qbc1
--- run O3
run: k.l abc1 x Qbc1
baked: k.l abc1 x Qbc1
--- interpret
run: k.l abc1 x Qbc1
baked: k.l abc1 x Qbc1
